 R←Test_SendEmail_43(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;connection
⍝ A wrong password is reported with the server's answer
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewParms
 parms.Password←'wrong'
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂parms)
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 →T.PassesIf 1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'535'≡3↑msg
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢∆SERVER.Messages

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
